{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your cards, upgrade your gear, and watch chaos unfold in this dark fantasy RPG set in a world corrupted by darkness</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD GONE DARK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a year, a lone warrior must carry the Lantern of Eternal Flame across a decaying world to reignite the lighthouse and keep hope alive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/extras/7bfb5e51195566d0db14776fe7b77d3f.poster.avif?t=1768935030\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/extras/7bfb5e51195566d0db14776fe7b77d3f.webm?t=1768935030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/extras/7bfb5e51195566d0db14776fe7b77d3f.mp4?t=1768935030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight through twisted lands, recruit allies, and reshape your build as corruption creeps in. No warrior has ever returned-yet the light always burns. And as long as you hold the Lantern, death is never the end</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>BUILD YOUR POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose cards. Equip powerful items &amp; relics. Shape your hero run by run. Every decision shifts your build and your odds of survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/extras/963a9fb523b4dd675b72f9fe29f5b66a.poster.avif?t=1768935030\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/extras/963a9fb523b4dd675b72f9fe29f5b66a.webm?t=1768935030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/extras/963a9fb523b4dd675b72f9fe29f5b66a.mp4?t=1768935030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy, chaotic combat \u2013 Deckbuilding meets explosive RPG auto-battles. Enemies burn, freeze, shatter, and melt as you and your summons tear through corrupted monstrosities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep custom character builds \u2013 Become a lone tank, a swarm-summoning shaman, or something in between. Build around cards, gear, and passives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ hand drawn items \u2013 Every item is unique and visually appears on your character in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big world map \u2013 Choose your path through story nodes, conquer quests, face grotesque bosses, and push toward the Lighthouse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord, so you can play earlier versions and give us feedback and suggestions! The link's on the right sidebar</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BONE BROTH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907920/7ac9f755d2cb8590d57cd7792e1ac3d606fb064f.jpg"},{"name":"CORRUPTHOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907920/099881344c7a335a405987bef8c78796647f3964.jpg"},{"name":"ENHANCER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907920/be6afa57abafe870b8143bd707017ed693dd3bf8.jpg"},{"name":"HALFWAY THERE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907920/a95c73385c2ee836dd5f8c048fdca04e7222fbae.jpg"},{"name":"ALL OR NOTHING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907920/5cebc87a1c1476fc5